  "description": "TUGCAC crystallizes in the rhombohedral crystal system with space group R -3. Reported CIF formula moiety: C136 H94 Dy3 N6 O11 1+,H1 O1 1-,7(H2 O1),3(C1 H2 Cl2). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.553-3.553 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.31-99.27°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy3(OH)(OMe)(L)3(dbm)3](OH)·3CH2Cl2·7H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
